      "mimeType": "application/json",
      "text": "{\"data\": {\"fareConditions\": [{\"conditions\": {\"condensedFareConditions\": \"Tickets are exchangeable up to 1 hour before your original departure time without a fee. If your new ticket is more expensive, you’ll pay the difference. If your new ticket is cheaper, the difference will not be refunded. Refundable with a €25/£25/$40 fee per person per leg up to 7 days before the date and time of departure. Tickets exchanged less than 7 days before the departure date will become non-refundable.\", \"tariffCode\": \"TB05PSDASBEN\", \"__typename\": \"FareCondition\"}, \"__typename\": \"FareConditions\"}, {\"conditions\": {\"condensedFareConditions\": \"Tickets are exchangeable up to 1 hour before your original departure time without a fee. If your new ticket is more expensive, you’ll pay the difference. If your new ticket is cheaper, the difference will not be refunded. Refundable with a €25/£25/$40 fee per person per leg up to 7 days before the date and time of departure. Tickets exchanged less than 7 days before the departure date will become non-refundable.\", \"tariffCode\": \"THCPSDASBEN\", \"__typename\": \"FareCondition\"}, \"__typename\": \"FareConditions\"}, {\"conditions\": {\"condensedFareConditions\": \"Tickets are exchangeable without a fee up to 48 hours after your original departure time. If your new ticket is more expensive, you will pay the difference. If your new ticket is cheaper, you will not receive a refund of the difference. Tickets are refundable without paying a fee 48 hours after your original departure time.\", \"tariffCode\": \"TACPFXASBEN\", \"__typename\": \"FareCondition\"}, \"__typename\": \"FareConditions\"}, {\"conditions\": {\"condensedFareConditions\": \"Tickets are exchangeable up to 1 hour before your original departure time without a fee. If your new ticket is more expensive, you’ll pay the difference. If your new ticket is cheaper, the difference will not be refunded. Refundable with a €25/£25/$40 fee per person per